---
import ScatteredCards from "./scattered-cards";
---

<section class="min-h-screen py-11">
  <div class="my-container">
    <div class="grid place-items-center">
      <div class="font-title flex flex-col items-end">
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-xl">...Story time</p>
        <h2 class="mb-16 text-6xl font-semibold">My Journey</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="my-container grid grid-cols-5 gap-6">
    <div class="bg-secondary col-span-2 rounded-3xl p-6">
      <p>
        Starting my journey in web development back in 2020, I was immediately
        captivated by the endless possibilities it offered. The ability to
        create interactive and dynamic experiences on the web fascinated me, and
        I knew I wanted to be a part of this ever-evolving field.
      </p>
      <br />
      <p>
        Hey, I’m Victor — a full-stack developer from Nigeria. I grew up in
        Benin City, where I first got hooked on tech through late-night
        cybercafé sessions and endless Googling. What started as curiosity
        quickly turned into passion. After moving to Lagos, I
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="bg-deeper-background border-secondary col-span-3 rounded-3xl border-[0.5px]"
    >
      <ScatteredCards client:load />
    </div>
    <div
      class="bg-deeper-background border-secondary col-span-3 rounded-3xl border-[0.5px] p-6"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="bg-secondary col-span-2 rounded-3xl p-6">
      <p>
        Over time, I’ve mastered languages like JavaScript, TypeScript, Python,
        and PHP — tools that power everything I build, from interactive
        frontends to scalable backend systems. Each project has sharpened my
        ability to write clean, efficient code and think critically about how
        tech can solve real-world problems.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="bg-deeper-background border-secondary col-span-5 rounded-3xl border-[0.5px] p-6"
    >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
